    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/3310f3292b4aaeecc166aa5bb1078800.poster.avif?t=1753261418\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/3310f3292b4aaeecc166aa5bb1078800.webm?t=1753261418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/3310f3292b4aaeecc166aa5bb1078800.mp4?t=1753261418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zon</strong> is a solo-developed, frantic bullet hell game that blends real-time base building with high-speed, skill-heavy combat. Dive into a vibrant, neon-soaked warzone where you must construct defenses, upgrade your ship, and annihilate your enemies in a storm of lasers, missiles, and explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build.  Upgrade. Dominate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match of\u00a0<strong>Zon</strong> starts with a rush: build up your base using generators, turrets, and walls while fending off early attacks. Whether solo or with teammates, your base is your lifeline. As you secure resources and take down enemies, you'll unlock powerful upgrades for your ship, allowing you to move faster, shoot harder, and survive longer against the ever-growing chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/f693c8d8cc157058625e8d91d1fdfe22.poster.avif?t=1753261418\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/f693c8d8cc157058625e8d91d1fdfe22.webm?t=1753261418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/f693c8d8cc157058625e8d91d1fdfe22.mp4?t=1753261418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP</strong> \u2013 Battle other players in fast-paced team fights or free-for-alls. Build up your base, then strike hard to take down the enemy. Victory is earned through coordination, aggression, and outmaneuvering your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvE</strong> \u2013 Face down endless waves of enemies in survival mode. Adapt your defenses, upgrade constantly, and see how long you can last before the screen fills with bullets and chaos reigns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/9bab3645d60f42256ee62214d10c68a4.poster.avif?t=1753261418\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/9bab3645d60f42256ee62214d10c68a4.webm?t=1753261418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/9bab3645d60f42256ee62214d10c68a4.mp4?t=1753261418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time base construction and defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully upgradeable player ship with multiple weapon types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision bullet-dodging and fast combat movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense particle-rich visual effects and colorful battlefields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple strategies: build defensively, strike aggressively, or control the map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love fast reaction times, satisfying upgrade loops, and the kind of chaos that fills the screen with color and carnage, <strong>Zon</strong> delivers pure, polished bullet hell mayhem.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/3310f3292b4aaeecc166aa5bb1078800.poster.avif?t=1753261418\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/3310f3292b4aaeecc166aa5bb1078800.webm?t=1753261418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/3310f3292b4aaeecc166aa5bb1078800.mp4?t=1753261418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zon</strong> is a solo-developed, frantic bullet hell game that blends real-time base building with high-speed, skill-heavy combat. Dive into a vibrant, neon-soaked warzone where you must construct defenses, upgrade your ship, and annihilate your enemies in a storm of lasers, missiles, and explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build.  Upgrade. Dominate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match of\u00a0<strong>Zon</strong> starts with a rush: build up your base using generators, turrets, and walls while fending off early attacks. Whether solo or with teammates, your base is your lifeline. As you secure resources and take down enemies, you'll unlock powerful upgrades for your ship, allowing you to move faster, shoot harder, and survive longer against the ever-growing chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/f693c8d8cc157058625e8d91d1fdfe22.poster.avif?t=1753261418\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/f693c8d8cc157058625e8d91d1fdfe22.webm?t=1753261418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/f693c8d8cc157058625e8d91d1fdfe22.mp4?t=1753261418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP</strong> \u2013 Battle other players in fast-paced team fights or free-for-alls. Build up your base, then strike hard to take down the enemy. Victory is earned through coordination, aggression, and outmaneuvering your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvE</strong> \u2013 Face down endless waves of enemies in survival mode. Adapt your defenses, upgrade constantly, and see how long you can last before the screen fills with bullets and chaos reigns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/9bab3645d60f42256ee62214d10c68a4.poster.avif?t=1753261418\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/9bab3645d60f42256ee62214d10c68a4.webm?t=1753261418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651110/extras/9bab3645d60f42256ee62214d10c68a4.mp4?t=1753261418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time base construction and defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully upgradeable player ship with multiple weapon types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision bullet-dodging and fast combat movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense particle-rich visual effects and colorful battlefields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple strategies: build defensively, strike aggressively, or control the map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love fast reaction times, satisfying upgrade loops, and the kind of chaos that fills the screen with color and carnage, <strong>Zon</strong> delivers pure, polished bullet hell mayhem.</p>",
    "short_description": "Zon is a fast-paced bullet hell game for 1\u20136 players, playable solo or multiplayer in both co-op and PvP modes. Build, upgrade and defend your base while trying to take down the enemy. Battle other players, AI enemies, dodge bullets, and use powerful weapons to survive and win.",
